[{"client_msg_id":"09b3699d-cc25-49ac-8734-466ea380587c","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"書きました。レビューお願いします。\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/vim-jp.github.io/pull/374\u003e","ts":"1622257450.037300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: docs: Revise How to Write Patches by k-takata · Pull Request #374 · vim-jp/vim-jp.github.io","id":1,"title":"docs: Revise How to Write Patches by k-takata · Pull Request #374 · vim-jp/vim-jp.github.io","title_link":"https://github.com/vim-jp/vim-jp.github.io/pull/374","text":"見出しを追加 Linuxでのビルド方法へのリンクを追加 コマンドを見直し git clone の URL に .git を追加 ビルド方法のページに合わせた git checkout -b =\u0026gt; git switch -c patch -p1 =\u0026gt; git apply git fetch のやり方 master ブランチをチェックアウトせずに最新に更新 git push のやり...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/4acb14476e69e3015c56dbb472546e000cb5147c6faeca054fdfc46c84b775f8/vim-jp/vim-jp.github.io/pull/374","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim-jp/vim-jp.github.io/pull/374","original_url":"https://github.com/vim-jp/vim-jp.github.io/pull/374"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0xc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"130f7ab0-55d0-4bd4-8619-b5860232cf8e","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"あとは、gvim で流すなら `VIMPROG=..\\gvim` を指定するとか（Windowsの場合）ぐらい？","ts":"1622221589.036800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=F4Zi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71d8283c-af46-47d7-a53c-61c04bbc108d","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`TEST_FILTER` については `runtest.vim` を参照。","ts":"1622220221.035500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qp7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"629aadfe-7c0b-4330-b349-49d971edf472","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"一応 `src/` からでも流せたはずだけど、個人的には使わない。","ts":"1622220150.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yLuG4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3515f13-6ae1-4df8-8077-017796bd7a7e","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"ファイル単位で流すだけなら `src/testdir/` で `make test_channel` とか `nmake -f Make_dos.mak test_channel` とかすれば良くて、さらに特定の関数のみ流すなら `make test_channel TEST_FILTER=Test_communicate` のような感じで。","ts":"1622220013.033900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"pray","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kpvg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21e9224b-2ce7-4f9c-8937-76233bbe4d70","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim 本体にパッチを書きたい時にテストを個別で回す方法を毎度忘れる…\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/docs/how_to_write_patches.html\u003e\nこのページにテストについての記載(あるいは別ページでも)があると嬉しいかもしれないです。","ts":"1622217116.030900","attachments":[{"fallback":"vim-jp.github.io: パッチの書き方","id":1,"title":"パッチの書き方","title_link":"https://vim-jp.org/docs/how_to_write_patches.html","text":"The website for \u003chttp://vim-jp.org|vim-jp.org\u003e","thumb_url":"https://vim-jp.org/assets/images/vim2-128.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"vim-jp.github.io","service_icon":"https://vim-jp.org/favicon.ico","thumb_width":128,"thumb_height":128,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.org/docs/how_to_write_patches.html","original_url":"https://vim-jp.org/docs/how_to_write_patches.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QoQB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1e0c90f-d5f6-4c3c-99de-ffc3ab2640a4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうそう。さっき久しぶりに見たらアイコンが重なってて?!ってなったw","ts":"1622215561.029700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gsxTy"}]}]
